WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:05.000
All the Riverbankers came to Toad's party.

2
00:00:05.001 --> 00:00:10.110
Toad Hall was full of lights and music.

3
00:00:10.111 --> 00:00:14.256
"What wonderful food," said a chipmunk.

4
00:00:14.257 --> 00:00:20.245
"Toad Hall is a grand home!" said a squirrel.

5
00:00:20.246 --> 00:00:24.126
Toad came down the stairs.

6
00:00:24.127 --> 00:00:30.155
"Hooray for Toad!" all the guests cried.

7
00:00:30.156 --> 00:00:33.061
"Thank you," said Toad.

8
00:00:33.062 --> 00:00:35.689
"I'm glad to be back."

9
00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:39.554
The other animals gathered around him.

10
00:00:39.555 --> 00:00:44.857
"You sure made the weasels run!" said a skunk.

11
00:00:44.858 --> 00:00:49.563
"Well, I had a lot of help," said Toad.

12
00:00:49.564 --> 00:00:54.415
"You must be a brave fighter!" said a raccoon.

13
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:59.300
"We all fought as a team," said Toad.

14
00:00:59.301 --> 00:01:02.947
"What courage!" said a young beaver.

15
00:01:02.948 --> 00:01:08.346
"You beat the Chief Weasel all by yourself!"

16
00:01:08.347 --> 00:01:11.952
"He's just a bully," said Toad.

17
00:01:11.953 --> 00:01:15.773
"Bullies scare easily."

18
00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:20.003
Otter ran over to hug Toad.

19
00:01:20.004 --> 00:01:23.475
"Our hero!" shouted Otter.

20
00:01:23.476 --> 00:01:26.773
"Everyone wants to hear about your fight!"

21
00:01:26.774 --> 00:01:32.612
"Badger was the leader," said Toad. "Not me."

22
00:01:32.613 --> 00:01:36.547
Badger and Rat watched Toad.

23
00:01:36.548 --> 00:01:40.101
"Listen to Toad!" said Badger.

24
00:01:40.102 --> 00:01:42.577
"Can you believe it?"

25
00:01:42.578 --> 00:01:47.215
"Toad has really changed!" said Rat.

26
00:01:47.216 --> 00:01:49.863
Badger was pleased.

27
00:01:49.864 --> 00:01:53.016
The party was wonderful.

28
00:01:53.017 --> 00:01:56.723
The guests laughed and talked.

29
00:01:56.724 --> 00:02:02.694
But they noticed that Toad was different.

30
00:02:02.695 --> 00:02:07.561
"Why doesn't Toad sing?" someone asked.

31
00:02:07.562 --> 00:02:12.417
Then everyone called for Toad to sing.

32
00:02:12.418 --> 00:02:19.386
"Toad! Toad! Sing us a song!" they cried.

33
00:02:19.387 --> 00:02:27.645
But Toad just shook his head and smiled.

